  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "First gen Gu Yue activates Blood Curtain Skyflower Gu on Qing Mao Mountain while sealed and facing Lord Sky Crane. Gu Masters destroy the sealed Gu to fire it; a blood light blooms into a spherical shield that cuts Lord Sky Crane’s white eyebrows from Raise Eyebrows & Exhale Gu and traps some fighters inside while leaving others out.",
        "chapters": [
          194
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_first_gen_gu_yue",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_lord_sky_crane",
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "gu_raise_eyebrows_and_exhale_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The chapter title prints Blood Curtain Skyflower. First gen Gu Yue names the Gu itself Blood Curtain Skyflower Gu when he teaches Lord Sky Crane what blocked the attack.",
        "chapters": [
          194
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing’s glacier fills the blood shield from inside and bursts the Blood Curtain Skyflower with a soft sound, after which the cold air spreads beyond the former barrier.",
        "chapters": [
          195
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "destruction",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan rebirths into the same crisis, the same sealed scarlet Gu drops again, the blood shield isolates the field a second time, and First gen Gu Yue again names it as his fused Blood Curtain Skyflower.",
        "chapters": [
          196
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-loop-after-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan tricks First gen Gu Yue outside the barrier, the shield blocks the ancestor from coming back in; Fang Yuan waits for First gen Gu Yue to lose and for the Blood Curtain Skyflower to vanish.",
        "chapters": [
          197
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-loop-after-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
